This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).
Its encoders are translations to Zig of the works below. Each translated
file names its source in its header. The translations keep the original
algorithms and arithmetic so that they produce the same bytes, and change
only the language, the structure needed to express it in Zig, and the
public interface.

